tle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x0015DE": "「憎しみや苦しみと共に……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001609": "「希望を捨てよ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001628": "「際限なき苦しみの果てへ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001656": "「断末魔の叫びを上げよ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001681": "「お前達の希望を打ち砕く……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x0016AF": "「これが……我が破滅……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x0016D7": "「我らの死も、また糧となる……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001708": "「ここで我らを打ち倒したところで……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001742": "「宿命は変わらぬぞ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001767": "「いずれ、お前にも破滅が……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001795": "「我らの代わりはいくらでも……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x0017C6": "「“破滅の王”の下に……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x0017EE": "「ここでの役目は終わった……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x00181C": "「何という……正と負が入り混じった波動……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x00185F": "「これでは……器がもたぬ……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001890": "「この器では……受け切れぬ……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x0018C4": "「何故、破滅の宿命を受け入れぬのだ……？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001904": "「認めよ……破滅の時は近い……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001935": "「何故……何故、希望を捨てぬ……？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x00196C": "「その闘志、力……危険だ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x00199A": "「まだ諦めぬのか……！」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x0019BF": "「飽くなき生への執着……それが……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x0019F6": "「宿命を変える気か……その力で……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001A2D": "「その力……最上の糧となる……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001A5E": "「我らは触媒に過ぎぬ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001A86": "「その意志……受け止めた……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001AB4": "「憎悪が……力が突き刺さる……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001AE5": "「どうあがこうと……結果は同じ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001B1C": "「この波動……処理できぬ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001B4A": "「呪え……全てを呪うのだ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001B78": "「全てが“破滅の王”の糧となる……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001BAF": "「もうお前達の運命は変わらぬと言うのに……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001BF2": "「あくまで希望を持ち続けるか……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001C26": "「我らを憎め……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001C42": "「その闘志も糧となる……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001C6A": "「呪え、我らを……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001C89": "「我らを止めることは出来ぬ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001CBA": "「憎悪を増幅させるがいい……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001CE8": "「お前の憎しみは、その程度か……？」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001D1F": "「足りぬ……もっと憎め、叫べ」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001D4D": "「心地よき負の波動……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001D72": "「その憎悪、闘志……我らが受け止めよう」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001DAF": "「あがけ……力の限り……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001DD7": "「怨嗟の声を上げよ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001DFC": "「諦めよ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001E12": "「我らルイーナには勝てぬ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001E40": "「苦悶し、呪いの声を上げよ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001E71": "「反撃不能……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001E8A": "「攻撃不可能……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001EA6": "「対処不可能……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001EC2": "「さらなる絶望を……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001EE4": "「滅びの宿命を受け入れよ……」", "Battle/Dat/Battle/Message/214.bmd|0x001F12": "「さらなる恐怖を……」"}